  {y : ¬b → α} {v : ¬c → α} (h₁ : b = c), (∀ (h : c), x_1 ⋯ = u h) → (∀ (h : ¬c), y ⋯ = v h) → dite b x_1 y = dite c u v
@dite_true : ∀ {α : Sort u_1} {t : True → α} {e : ¬True → α}, dite True t e = t True.intro
